{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10130090","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10130090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1013009001:0":{"text":"魔像の頭部に、なにやら特殊な機構がはめ込まれている。こやつのエネルギー源か……？","source_cn":"魔偶的头部镶嵌着某个特殊结构。看起来像是它行动的能源……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66C1F9F003322D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013009002:0":{"text":"つまり、エネルギー源が破壊されたから、魔像の動きが止まったんだな？","source_cn":"所以，魔偶停下来，是因为它的能源被破坏了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34309D20D2B2C444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1013009002":{"text":"つまり、エネルギー源が破壊されたから、魔像の動きが止まったんだな？","source_cn":"所以，魔偶停下来，是因为它胸口的能源被破坏了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34309D20D2B2C444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013009003:1":{"text":"私も同意見だ。もしかしたら、これで魔像の凶行を止められるかもしれない。","source_cn":"我也赞同两位的意见，或许这将成为我们制止魔偶为祸的途径之一。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x825739E55D3698E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013009005:1":{"text":"残念だが、今のところ俺たちが把握している情報はこれだけだな。","source_cn":"很可惜，就现在而言，我们只能获取到这些信息了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x025DBEA3D05BF5A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_t